                                skos:definition "Juvenile freshwater residence of one year or more: juveniles overwinter at least once in fresh water before migrating seaward, and therefore carry at least one freshwater annulus on the scale."@en ;
                                skos:inScheme smn:JuvenileFreshwaterResidenceDurationScheme ;
                                skos:prefLabel "Yearling or older freshwater residence"@en .


